  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Edge",
      "items": [
        "Caddy exists to renew certificates; nginx already does the routing",
        "One origin end to end, so there is no CORS configuration anywhere",
        "nginx sets X-Real-IP from Caddy, which stops a client spoofing the per-IP sign-up limiter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Inside api — dependencies point inward",
      "items": [
        "internal/domain — money as int64 minor units, currency, roles; standard library only",
        "internal/usecase — services plus ports.go; no service takes an actor parameter",
        "internal/adapter — http, postgres, mail, telegram, crypto, clock and fx implement those ports",
        "make lint-arch enforces the direction, test files included"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Dashed means off on this box",
      "items": [
        "DATABASE_READONLY_URL unset — /admin/db/* answers 503, no fallback to DATABASE_URL",
        "TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN empty — the route answers 404 and the poller never starts",
        "Mail stops at Mailpit; that inbox is an auth bypass, so 8025 binds to 127.0.0.1 and is read over an SSH tunnel",
        "Nightly plain-SQL dump encrypted to R2; the private key is not on the box"
      ]
    }
  ]
